# Vite's output directory for the dashboard SPA, embedded into Vortex.Dashboard.API at build time
# (see that project's BuildDashboardFrontend target). Every name in it is content-hashed, so
# tracking it made a one-line Svelte change rewrite ~50 unreadable files. It is generated, never
# edited: `dotnet build` produces it, and refuses to embed an empty one.
Vortex.Dashboard.API/Assets/

